 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs**
-*   **Input**: A dictionary of Gaussian splat parameters with keys `'means'`, `'quats'`, `'scales'`, `'opacities'`, and `'sh0'` (and optionally `'shN'` for higher-order bands). The input arrays are typically float32.
